# Raw captures stay out of the repository: they are big, they are personal
# (they carry your broker address and anything the bridge put on P1P2/S) and the
# offline tests only need the scrubbed copies. Everything here is ignored except
# this file, the README and files that went through tools/scrub_capture.sh.
*
!README.md
!.gitignore
!*_scrubbed.log
!*_scrubbed.log.gz
